    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369500/extras/4b99c2d1dc73101d837652485490c95d.poster.avif?t=1748702342\" width=600 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369500/extras/4b99c2d1dc73101d837652485490c95d.webm?t=1748702342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369500/extras/4b99c2d1dc73101d837652485490c95d.mp4?t=1748702342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Querent is a truly unique tactical role playing game. Explore an alternate Southwest America as an exile of the government to uncover a dark force possessing local animals. Recruit and unite the locals to utilize their unique hypnotic skills. Free the animals under the mesmerism of something deep below the town of Sunset Junction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369500/extras/6a3b777c5a69b29a40e8b89ce9396fd2.avif?t=1748702342\" width=598 height=76 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369500/extras/448dff5caf2ef44453423351a07307a0.webp?t=1748702342\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the appearance and body type of your exile. Build your deck as you play to decide what kind of person you will become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369500/extras/7da687ae9bf3e5bf976b899c838f9d25.poster.avif?t=1748702342\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369500/extras/7da687ae9bf3e5bf976b899c838f9d25.webm?t=1748702342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369500/extras/7da687ae9bf3e5bf976b899c838f9d25.mp4?t=1748702342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369500/extras/d0abacf96c244f89310ecb0241fcb891.webp?t=1748702342\" width=320 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your skill deck from  6 suits. Will you use true grit, harness the power of nature, or energize your party with your natural wit? The combinations are endless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369500/extras/80e74418cb800b591e15e1e1f0f92414.poster.avif?t=1748702342\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369500/extras/80e74418cb800b591e15e1e1f0f92414.webm?t=1748702342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369500/extras/80e74418cb800b591e15e1e1f0f92414.mp4?t=1748702342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369500/extras/26678cf4bb174448e13b7b6b14a13ae3.webp?t=1748702342\" width=410 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock mesmeric abilities you can use to free animals or break through barriers to your path.\u00a0Build a deck for each character in a fast paced turn based battle system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369500/extras/7ab823208d674131070e17e4ae976dfa.poster.avif?t=1748702342\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369500/extras/7ab823208d674131070e17e4ae976dfa.webm?t=1748702342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369500/extras/7ab823208d674131070e17e4ae976dfa.mp4?t=1748702342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369500/extras/b2d3376d1af9a01bc5cf8c517fde43aa.webp?t=1748702342\" width=462 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit a diverse group of your fellow exiles and unlock their hidden abilities. Build your relationships to unite the exiles against a dark force living beneath your feet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369500/extras/99af8c421fd7fdb2bf665ec50c967642.avif?t=1748702342\" width=600 height=379 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369500/extras/313e27f6c8ff3bc43980071205991645.webp?t=1748702342\" width=494 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No obstacle has only one solution. Use different skills or party members to overcome any challenge that awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse